/* EdgeOS */
"%@ is not a VLAN-aware switch0 port. On EdgeOS, VLANs work only on switch0 ports with vlan-aware enabled." = "%@ 不是支援 VLAN 的 switch0 連接埠。在 EdgeOS 上，VLAN 只能用於啟用 vlan-aware 的 switch0 連接埠。";
"Another change on the router is already waiting for confirmation. Confirm it or let its timer run out first." = "路由器上已有另一項變更在等待確認。請先確認它，或等它的計時器到期。";
"EdgeOS can't change a VLAN's number. Delete the VLAN and add it again with the new number." = "EdgeOS 無法變更 VLAN 的編號。請刪除該 VLAN，再以新編號重新新增。";
"Netdeck could not check whether the running configuration is saved. Changes that were never saved are lost if the router restarts with its saved configuration." = "Netdeck 無法檢查執行中的設定是否已儲存。若路由器以其已儲存的設定重新啟動，從未儲存的變更會遺失。";
"Netdeck stopped the confirm timer and loaded the saved configuration again." = "Netdeck 已停止確認計時器，並重新載入已儲存的設定。";
"On EdgeOS a VLAN has only a name (the description of its switch0 vif). Rename the VLAN instead." = "在 EdgeOS 上，VLAN 只有名稱（其 switch0 vif 的說明）。請改為重新命名 VLAN。";
"The confirm timer is still running: the router restarts with its saved configuration when it runs out." = "確認計時器仍在執行：到期時，路由器會以其已儲存的設定重新啟動。";
"The router keeps no commit revisions, so EdgeOS can't arm its confirm timer. Turn on commit revisions (system config-management commit-revisions) first." = "路由器不保留提交修訂版，因此 EdgeOS 無法啟用其確認計時器。請先開啟提交修訂版（system config-management commit-revisions）。";
"The router rejected some commands:" = "路由器拒絕了部分指令：";
"The running configuration has changes that were never saved. If you don't confirm in time, the router restarts with its saved configuration and those changes are lost as well." = "執行中的設定有從未儲存的變更。若你未及時確認，路由器會以其已儲存的設定重新啟動，這些變更也會遺失。";
"This EdgeOS version has no commit-confirm, so Netdeck can't apply changes with a safety timer." = "此 EdgeOS 版本沒有 commit-confirm，因此 Netdeck 無法以安全計時器套用變更。";
"VLAN 1 is the default VLAN; EdgeOS keeps the name 'default' for it." = "VLAN 1 是預設 VLAN；EdgeOS 為它保留名稱「default」。";
"VLANs on EdgeOS need the switch0 interface with vlan-aware enabled. Set that up on the router first." = "EdgeOS 上的 VLAN 需要啟用 vlan-aware 的 switch0 介面。請先在路由器上設定。";

/* Cisco IOS */
"This switch's IOS can't undo changes on its own (no revert timer). Netdeck doesn't apply changes without it." = "此交換器的 IOS 無法自行復原變更（沒有 revert timer）。沒有它，Netdeck 不會套用變更。";
"Netdeck needs privileged mode on this switch. Log in with a privilege 15 user or give the enable password." = "Netdeck 需要此交換器的特權模式。請以特權等級 15 的使用者登入，或提供 enable 密碼。";
"Netdeck couldn't set up the configuration archive the revert timer needs:" = "Netdeck 無法建立 revert timer 所需的設定封存：";
"IOS has no candidate configuration to check in advance. The switch checks each command as it is applied; if one is rejected, or if you don't confirm in time, the revert timer puts the previous configuration back." = "IOS 沒有可預先檢查的候選設定。交換器會在套用每個指令時檢查；若有指令被拒絕，或你未及時確認，revert timer 會還原先前的設定。";
"The configuration archive the revert timer needs is not set up yet. Netdeck turns it on first (archive path flash:netdeck), outside the timer; this doesn't affect traffic." = "revert timer 所需的設定封存尚未建立。Netdeck 會先將它開啟（archive path flash:netdeck），在計時器之外進行；這不會影響流量。";
"The switch shut this port down after an error (err-disabled)." = "交換器因發生錯誤而關閉了此連接埠（err-disabled）。";
"%@: IOS doesn't accept '?' in a description." = "%@：IOS 不接受說明中含有「?」。";
"%@ is a routed port (no switchport). Netdeck doesn't change VLANs on routed ports." = "%@ 是路由連接埠（no switchport）。Netdeck 不會變更路由連接埠上的 VLAN。";
"%@ belongs to Port-channel%@; its VLANs follow the port-channel. Netdeck doesn't change them." = "%@ 屬於 Port-channel%@；其 VLAN 跟隨 port-channel。Netdeck 不會變更它們。";
"VLANs 1002–1005 are reserved on Cisco switches." = "VLAN 1002–1005 在 Cisco 交換器上為保留編號。";
"'%@': IOS VLAN names can't contain spaces or '?' and are at most 32 characters." = "「%@」：IOS 的 VLAN 名稱不可包含空格或「?」，且最多 32 個字元。";
"IOS VLANs have no description. Leave it empty." = "IOS 的 VLAN 沒有說明。請留空。";
"IOS can't change a VLAN's number. Add a VLAN with the new number and move the ports to it." = "IOS 無法變更 VLAN 的編號。請以新編號新增一個 VLAN，並將連接埠移過去。";
