"The device refused to start an SSH shell." = "裝置拒絕啟動 SSH shell。";
"The device's SSH algorithms aren't supported by the built-in SSH client: %@" = "內建 SSH 用戶端不支援此裝置的 SSH 演算法:%@";
"SSH algorithms: %@" = "SSH 演算法:%@";
"SSH, older algorithms" = "SSH(舊版演算法)";
"%@ belongs to %@; its VLANs follow the LAG. Netdeck doesn't change them." = "%@ 屬於 %@；其 VLAN 跟隨 LAG。Netdeck 不會變更它們。";
"%@ is a routed port. Netdeck doesn't change VLANs on routed ports." = "%@ 是路由連接埠。Netdeck 不會變更路由連接埠上的 VLAN。";
"%@: '?' can't be typed in a description on this switch." = "%@：此交換器的描述中無法輸入「?」。";
"%@: a trunk port must carry at least one VLAN. With none, AOS-CX carries them all." = "%@：trunk 連接埠至少要承載一個 VLAN。一個都沒有時，AOS-CX 會承載全部 VLAN。";
"'%@': AOS-CX VLAN names are 1–32 characters: letters, digits, '_' and '-'." = "「%@」：AOS-CX 的 VLAN 名稱為 1–32 個字元：字母、數字、「_」和「-」。";
"AOS-CX %@ may not restore the configuration if the session drops before you confirm (fixed in 10.06). Update the switch to make changes with Netdeck." = "若在你確認前工作階段中斷，AOS-CX %@ 可能不會還原設定（已於 10.06 修正）。請更新交換器後再用 Netdeck 變更。";
"AOS-CX commands" = "AOS-CX 指令";
"Another change is already waiting for confirmation on this switch (an auto checkpoint is running). Netdeck doesn't apply changes until it ends." = "此交換器上已有另一項變更在等待確認（auto checkpoint 正在執行）。在它結束前，Netdeck 不會套用變更。";
"If you don't confirm, the switch restores the configuration it had before the change." = "若你未確認，交換器會還原變更前的設定。";
"Netdeck couldn't save the configuration before the change:" = "Netdeck 無法儲存變更前的設定：";
"Netdeck needs administrator rights on this switch. Log in as an administrator or manager user." = "Netdeck 需要此交換器的管理員權限。請以 administrator 或 manager 使用者登入。";
"The switch can't change a VLAN's number. Add a VLAN with the new number and move the ports to it." = "交換器無法變更 VLAN 的編號。請以新編號新增一個 VLAN，並將連接埠移過去。";
"The switch has no candidate configuration to check in advance. It applies each command at once; if one is rejected, or if you don't confirm in time, it restores the configuration it had before the change." = "交換器沒有可事先檢查的候選設定。它會立即套用每個指令；若有指令遭拒，或你未及時確認，它會還原變更前的設定。";
"This switch can't undo changes on its own (no auto checkpoint). Netdeck doesn't apply changes without it." = "此交換器無法自行復原變更（沒有 auto checkpoint）。沒有它，Netdeck 不會套用變更。";
"%@: a description can't contain '\"'." = "%@：描述中不能包含「\"」。";
"%@: the port must stay a member of at least one VLAN." = "%@：連接埠必須至少保留在一個 VLAN 中。";
"'%@': VLAN names on this switch are 1–32 characters and can't contain '\"'." = "「%@」：此交換器的 VLAN 名稱為 1–32 個字元，不能包含「\"」。";
"AOS-S commands" = "AOS-S 指令";
"Another change is already waiting for confirmation on this switch (Netdeck's restore job is scheduled). Netdeck doesn't apply changes until it ends." = "此交換器上已有另一項變更在等待確認（Netdeck 的還原工作已排定）。在它結束前，Netdeck 不會套用變更。";
"Netdeck couldn't set up the job that restores the configuration:" = "Netdeck 無法設定還原設定的工作：";
"This switch's VLANs have no description. Leave it empty." = "此交換器的 VLAN 沒有描述。請留空。";
"This switch's firmware (%@) can't restore a configuration without restarting; that needs 16.05 or later. Netdeck reads it but doesn't change it." = "此交換器的韌體（%@）無法在不重新啟動的情況下還原設定；需要 16.05 或更新版本。Netdeck 只讀取它，不會變更。";
